                <pb facs="1082" n="1076" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1076"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Oath of Government officer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. ——.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hawaiian Islands</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Island of ——, District of ——, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>I, ——, aged ——, a native of ——, residing at ——, in said district, do solemnly
                    swear, in the presence of Almighty God, that I will support and bear true
                    allegiance to the Provisional Government of the Hawaiian Islands, and faithfully
                    perform the duties appertaining to the office or employment of ——.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">—— ——.</p>
                <p>Subscribed and sworn to before me this—day of——, A. D. 1893.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">—— ——.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">No. ——.]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hawaiian Islands</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Island of ——, District of——, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>I, the undersigned, —— ——, do hereby certify that —— ——, aged ——, a native of——,
                    residing at ——, in said district, has this day taken, before me, the oath to
                    support and bear true allegiance to the Provisional Government of the Hawaiian
                    Islands, and faithfully perform the duties appertaining to the office or
                    employment of ——.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">—— ——,<lb/>—— ——,</p>
                <p>——, ——, 1893.</p>
            </div>
